{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And thorns and thistles it shall sprout to you.</b> Until now the decree of 'and it shall descend,' etc., was in force, and you did not need to guard an orchard or grove; but from now on you will need to, and it shall sprout thorns and thistles for you to fence your orchard and grove so that the beasts of the field shall not enter. And <b>it shall sprout</b> refers back to the ground."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:02:46.975736273Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}